WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:03.567
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:05.067
We hope you're all
doing well tonight.

00:00:05.067 --> 00:00:07.167
And now, if you don't mind,
we are gonna get to the news.

00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:10.067
According to a new report,
some of President Biden's

00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:12.033
top allies are quietly meeting

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:14.367
with Democratic officials
and donors

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:17.334
ahead of the 2024 election
in case he doesn't run.

00:00:17.334 --> 00:00:19.667
Well, quietly,
aside from the person

00:00:19.667 --> 00:00:21.968
who keeps coughing the word
"Hillary."

00:00:21.968 --> 00:00:23.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.701 --> 00:00:26.267
First Lady Dr. Jill Biden
met today with

00:00:26.267 --> 00:00:28.400
Ukrainian First Lady
Olena Zelenska

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.000
at the White House.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.400
"Sorry for everything your
country is going through,"

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:33.934
said Zelenska.

00:00:33.934 --> 00:00:36.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.834 --> 00:00:39.234
Elon Musk was photographed
over the weekend

00:00:39.234 --> 00:00:41.534
aboard a luxury yacht
in Mykonos, Greece,

00:00:41.534 --> 00:00:43.901
and all I can say is wow!

00:00:43.901 --> 00:00:46.133
He is...

00:00:46.133 --> 00:00:49.601
He is so white,
the sun had to put on sunscreen!

00:00:49.601 --> 00:00:51.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.701 --> 00:00:54.200
He looks like
the page in the coloring book

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:56.334
you haven't gotten to yet.

00:00:56.334 --> 00:00:57.567
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.567 --> 00:01:01.100
Is he partying on that yacht...

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:02.601
or is he haunting it?

00:01:02.601 --> 00:01:04.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.234
I will say, though --
I will say, he does have

00:01:06.234 --> 00:01:09.767
the skin tone of somebody who
is very good with technology.

00:01:09.767 --> 00:01:11.501
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.501 --> 00:01:14.734
Steven Spielberg recently
directed his first music video

00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:16.767
using his smartphone,
which is surprising

00:01:16.767 --> 00:01:20.667
because most people his age
record concerts on their iPads.

00:01:20.667 --> 00:01:22.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.467 --> 00:01:24.400
In a new interview,
a couple who has been married

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:26.701
for nearly 80 years
said that their secret

00:01:26.701 --> 00:01:28.167
to a long-lasting relationship

00:01:28.167 --> 00:01:30.868
is always sharing a kiss
before bedtime.

00:01:30.868 --> 00:01:33.834
"Same," said those freaks
from "Willy Wonka."

00:01:33.834 --> 00:01:36.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.801 --> 00:01:39.601
New York Governor Kathy Hochul
announced yesterday

00:01:39.601 --> 00:01:42.234
she will expand
shark-patrol crews

00:01:42.234 --> 00:01:45.601
amid an increase
of attacks on Long Island.

00:01:45.601 --> 00:01:48.200
Meanwhile, Republican governors
are encouraging residents

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:50.434
to buy sharks for protection.

00:01:50.434 --> 00:01:53.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.834 --> 00:01:57.267
The only thing
that stops a shark

00:01:57.267 --> 00:01:59.334
is a good guy with a shark.

00:01:59.334 --> 00:02:01.467
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.367 --> 00:02:05.667
And finally,
according to a new survey,

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:07.234
11% of Americans said that

00:02:07.234 --> 00:02:09.167
their favorite ice-cream flavor
is vanilla.

00:02:09.167 --> 00:02:12.167
Well, if you love vanilla,
I got good news for you!

00:02:12.167 --> 00:02:15.467
There it is!
That was a monologue, you guys.

